## Root Cause
The use of string concatenation in the exec function allows for command injection vulnerabilities.

## Explanation
The patch changes the use of exec to execFile, which executes a file with specified arguments in a safer manner. By using an array for arguments, it eliminates the possibility of command injection through unsanitized input from req.body.address.

